    Fix stale judiciary_independence string post-Act 15
    
    Act 15 (Judiciary Independence and Measurement Act, enacted 2026-10-17)
    made the Judiciary a non-voting independent measurement office. The
    measurement script still reported 'provisional; voting seat needs
    parliamentary reform', misrepresenting the governance state to the
    Legislature (Art VI transparency concern).
    
    Updated to: 'non-voting independent measurement office (Act 15, enacted 2026-10-17)'

